  "lore": "Johnny Storm, also known as the Human Torch, is a member of the Fantastic Four from Marvel Comics. After gaining the ability to ignite his body in flames, he developed powers of flight, fire manipulation, and explosive heat attacks while becoming one of Marvel’s most iconic superheroes."
